# NestJS Module Conventions

## Layer structure

```
src/modules/<name>/
  application/<name>.service.ts      # business logic
  infrastructure/<name>.repository.ts # Prisma only
  presentation/<name>.controller.ts   # HTTP + decorators
  presentation/dto/*.dto.ts           # Zod DTOs
  <name>.module.ts
```

Controller는 service에 위임만. Repository는 PrismaService만 사용.

## DTOs

- Request/response 모두 **Zod + nestjs-zod** (`createZodDto`)
- List response: `createPaginatedResponseSchema()` from `@/common/dto/pagination.dto`
- OpenAPI: `@ApiController({ tag, group, description? })` on class, `@ApiEndpoint({ title, status, response, errorStatuses, isPublic?, tag?, group? })` on handlers

## RBAC

모든 protected endpoint에 `@RequirePermissions(...)` 필수 (public 제외).

새 권한 추가 순서:
1. `src/infrastructure/rbac/rbac.definitions.ts` — `RBAC_ENTITIES`에 entity/action 추가
2. `src/infrastructure/rbac/rbac.catalog.ts` — `RBAC.<entity>.<action>` 추가 (`perm()` 사용)
3. `src/infrastructure/rbac/rbac.grants.ts` — role grants 추가
4. Controller handler에 `@RequirePermissions(RBAC.x.y)` 적용

## Audit log

주요 상태 변경 시 `AuditLogService.record()` 호출.
새 action은 `src/modules/audit-log/application/audit-log.actions.ts`에 추가.

## Auth decorators

- `@CurrentUserId()` / `@CurrentUser()` — 인증 사용자
- Public: `@ApiEndpoint({ isPublic: true })`

## Example controller handler

```typescript
@Controller('users')
@ApiController({ tag: 'Users', group: 'Application', description: '...' })
export class UsersController {
  @Get()
  @RequirePermissions(RBAC.user.list)
  @ApiPaginationQuery()
  @ApiEndpoint({ title: '목록', status: 200, response: ListDto, errorStatuses: [401, 403] })
  list(@Query() query: PaginationQueryDto) {
    return this.service.list(query);
  }
}
```

## New module

`src/app.module.ts` imports에 등록. Global infra는 `src/infrastructure/`에만 추가.
